{"name": "The Maker Way", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arizona, 2039. The government locked the desert down to store confiscated tech data and human knowledge. Your job is to take it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design machines from parts. 3D-print them.  Use your machines to break into bases, steal the drives, and hack servers. Fight the robots that guard them. Bring the data home to outposts that store it, charge your machines, load ammo, and refuel for the next raid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person sandbox engineering in an open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design Machines and Print Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineer a fleet of machines. Use mechanical parts, engines, weapons, and electronics to build machines that drive, fly, fight, mine resources, hack and more.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.poster.avif?t=1793164601\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.webm?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.mp4?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Bases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and expand your network of bases. Build fueling stations, research facilities, resource storage silos and defense outposts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.poster.avif?t=1793164601\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.webm?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.mp4?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Source Energy, Resources and Parts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an open world to discover new parts, source energy, and mine resources to upgrade and expand your fleet of machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.poster.avif?t=1793164601\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.webm?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.mp4?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight or Outsmart Government Robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate enemy bases guarded by robots and drones. Fight your way through or use advanced electronics to stay unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.poster.avif?t=1793164601\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.webm?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.mp4?t=1793164601\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Design machines from parts, 3D-print them, and control your fleet. Build outposts to store data, charge, and refuel. Fight government robots and break into bases to retrieve lost knowledge. First-person sandbox engineering.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/c9a3c11135c40d21dfe63709bf0ab1946b0e8a1d/header.jpg?t=1793164601", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Simulation", "Sandbox", "Physics", "Building", "Open World"], "developers": "Brave Games Inc.", "publishers": "Brave Games Inc.", "release_date": "Nov 11, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1532270", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/N7lpom91mQw", "first_seen": 1793055600.0, "review_rank": 9}